      <h1>European Battery Manufacturers</h1>
      <p class="muted">Manufacturer Directory · Last reviewed 2026-09</p>

      <div class="box">
        <strong>Direct answer:</strong> Europe's battery makers split into two layers: a
        <strong>lead-acid legacy</strong> led by <strong>Varta (Clarios)</strong> and an
        <strong>industrial specialist</strong> in <strong>Saft</strong>, plus a
        <strong>lithium build-out</strong> of new producers — <strong>ACC</strong> (Stellantis / Mercedes /
        TotalEnergies), <strong>PowerCo</strong> (Volkswagen) and others — driven by EU policy and automotive
        demand.
      </div>

